&ANALYZE-RESUME

&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _FUNCTION-FORWARD desa1 B-table-Win 
FUNCTION desa1 RETURNS LOGICAL
  ( /* parameter-definitions */ )  FORWARD.

