FUNCTION oc RETURNS CHARACTER
  ( /* parameter-definitions */ )  FORWARD.

/* _UIB-CODE-BLOCK-END */
&ANALYZE-RESUME

&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _FUNCTION-FORWARD PEVENTO B-table-Win 
FUNCTION PEVENTO RETURNS LOGICAL
  ( )  FORWARD.

